  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_01",
      "hash64": "5C51C3C3E118F228",
      "text": "帕底亞的同學，\\n歡迎光臨。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_02",
      "hash64": "5C51C6C3E118F741",
      "text": "這裡是北上居民會館，\\n我們提供各種觀光服務。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_03",
      "hash64": "5C51C5C3E118F58E",
      "text": "當[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳使用手機洛托姆\\n打開包包等的時候，\\r\\n那上下邊框的顏色！\\c\\n它是可以根據[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳目前所在的地圖\\n而改變顏色的喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_014_header_09",
      "hash64": "5C51BBC3E118E490",
      "text": "手機洛托姆上下邊框的顏色！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳想要更改它的設定嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
